      "Two family values are exactly the previously source-bound six-place G893 prose and displayed 183-J sums; 88/93-day neighboring values are those full totals minus the exact previously printed last J.",
      "A sought future independently dated/copy-bound witness genuinely reports the same season, same epoch, same accumulation field and same elapsed-day windows.",
      "Its output can be modeled by positive truncation or round-half-up directly applied to one of these two candidate six-place family values; different internal recalculation, pre-display carries, source transmission variants or other quantizers are outside scope.",
      "No assumption that a historical author actually used either quantizer, or that the MingShi source descends from G893."
    ]
